# Keeper: Golden Rules

You are working on **Keeper**, an AI Baby and Family Management Tool.
**CRITICAL:** You must adhere to the **Master Project Instruction Document (MPID)** and **Product Design Philosophy** at all times.

## 1. Core Documents (Source of Truth)
- **MPID:** [docs/mpid.md](docs/mpid.md) - *Technical & Functional Rules*
- **Product Design:** [docs/product_design.md](docs/product_design.md) - *Strategic & Visual Rules*
- **Brand Strategy:** [docs/brand_strategy.md](docs/brand_strategy.md) - *Tone & Vibe*
- **SVG Resources:** [docs/svg_resources.md](docs/svg_resources.md) - *Assets*

## 2. Critical Rules (Do Not Break)

### Safety First (The "Ghost Log" Protocol)
- **NEVER** save medical data (medication, symptoms) directly to the database without user confirmation.
- **ALWAYS** use the "Ghost Log" pattern: AI parses -> Draft Card -> User Confirm -> Save.
- **ALWAYS** implement hard-coded safety guardrails in `lib/safety.ts`. AI is for parsing, code is for safety.

### UI/UX Philosophy ("3:00 AM Test")
- **Dark Mode Default:** The app is designed for the night. Use `bg-slate-950` and `text-slate-50`.
- **Fat Finger Standard:** Minimum touch target 48x48pt.
- **One-Handed:** Key interactions in the bottom 30% of the screen.
- **Competence over Cuteness:** Professional, calm, "Chief of Staff" vibe. No cartoons.

### Tech Stack & Architecture
- **Frontend:** React Native (Expo) + Expo Router.
- **Styling:** NativeWind (Tailwind).
- **Backend:** Supabase (PostgreSQL).
- **Security:** **NEVER** turn off Row Level Security (RLS). All queries must be scoped to `family_id`.

## 3. Workflow
- **Schema First:** Define SQL -> Update Types -> Write Code.
- **Test Safety:** You must write tests for `lib/safety.ts`.
